                                                "sense_id": "6e3c2786-77b7-3d98-8632-d6201a0ca7f6",
                                                "text": "My thanes and kinsmen,/Henceforth be earls, the first that ever Scotland /In such an honour named"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d23453d5-b1af-484b-aaae-4183313a2f55",
                                                "sense_id": "6e3c2786-77b7-3d98-8632-d6201a0ca7f6",
                                                "text": "Henceforth, you shall be known as Darth...Vader."
